<details><summary>Reveal the jump invariance proof</summary>
Membership moves forward under exact simulation. Escape is preserved by contradiction: destination membership of the successor would move backward and violate source escape. Reversing the two models proves equivalence.
</details>

## Reduction pipeline

If $x\in A$ exactly when $f(x)\in B$, and the architecture can precompile a solver with $f$ at no added cost, a budget $b$ for $B$ becomes $b\circ f$ for $A$. This is the precise bridge from semantic reduction to quantitative reuse.

